        "w": 1695,
        "h": 2580,
        "sha256": "51796ced1bb6abc743e56b8ebeac3d332fcf6fe64b6511af4929878418779264"
      },
      "profile": {
        "id": "soviet-cn",
        "sha256": "dad8d974ba16880482f359073263269de8c405ccf8cb17dc4215fad11da44849"
      },
      "notes": [
        "本页实际从新题516开始，未重复上一页的栏目标题。520的“在这里，用S表示曲边梯形的面积。”属于同一题的定义说明，不是另一个正文对象。",
        "本页最后一题529在“重心。”处局部闭合；下一张本批原图142实际开启第八章，因此第七章补充题右界位于529之后、第八章标题之前。补充题左界仍只有父代理关于138页的文字传递。",
        "本页未见插图或新标题；页边散点未认作正文，未设置count_exclusions或人工期望行数。",
        "唯一独立源比较及新原生裁图确认520的“情况下”与“我们”之间有逗号，恢复作者遗漏的该标点；原稿及原手工inventory均已原字节保存，不回写历史。518旁孤立小印的意图仍UNKNOWN，不当作导数或新增标点。"
      ],
      "errata": [],
      "printed_lines": 23,
      "figures": [],
      "provenance": {
        "cap": "1",
        "normalized": true
      }
    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "516",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "516. * $\\int_a^b f(x)dx\\leqslant\\int_a^b g(x)dx$，设在闭区间$[a,b]$上，",
          "$f(x)\\leqslant g(x)$。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "517",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "517. * $\\int_{-a}^{+a} f(x)dx=0$，设对于闭区间$[-a,+a]$内所有的$x$，",
          "$f(-x)=-f(x)$。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "518",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "518. * $\\int_{-a}^{+a} f(x)dx=2\\int_0^a f(x)dx$，设对闭区间$[-a,a]$内所有",
          "的$x$，$f(-x)=f(x)$。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "519",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "519. * $\\left|\\int_a^b f(x)dx\\right|\\leqslant\\int_a^b |f(x)|dx$，当$a<b$时。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "520",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "520. * 设图形由直线和曲线$y=f(x)$，$y=0$，$x=a$，$x=b$围成，",
          "并且在闭区间$[a,b]$上，$f(x)\\leqslant 0$。在这种情况下，我们",
          "把这个图形也叫做曲边梯形。证明",
          "$\\int_a^b f(x)dx=-S$。",
          "在这里，用$S$表示曲边梯形的面积。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "521",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "521. * 证明：相似曲边梯形面积的比等于相似系数的平方。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "522",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "522. * 证明：半轴是$a$和$b$的椭圆的面积等于$\\pi ab$。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "523",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "523. * 求均匀直圆锥的重心。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "524",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "524. * 求均匀半球的重心。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "525",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "525. * 把轴线直立的均匀直圆锥浸入水中（锥顶向下）。求在",
          "这种情况下反抗水的推力所作的功。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "526",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "526. * 当把球浸入水中时，试确定反抗水的推力所作的功。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "527",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "527. * 求均匀半圆的重心。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "528",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "528. * 求均匀正棱锥的重心。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "ex",
        "label": "529",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "529. * 求圆心角为$2\\alpha$的均匀圆弧的重心。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "foot",
        "label": null,
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "• 135 •"
        ]
      }
    ]
