        "lines": [
          "第八章 指数函数、对数",
          "函数和幂函数"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "h2",
        "label": null,
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "§21. 指数函数的导函数"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "h3",
        "label": null,
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "108. 指数函数"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "p",
        "label": null,
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": true,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "你们从八年级的教程里，已经知道什么是以正数$a$为底",
          "的指数函数。对于这类函数，"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "fig",
        "label": "图 67",
        "box": [
          727,
          1086,
          631,
          1048
        ],
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [],
        "id": "fig-67"
      },
      {
        "kind": "p",
        "label": null,
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": true,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "我们有时使用新的符号，不",
          "写$a^x$，而写成$\\exp_a(x)$：$a^x=↵\\exp_a(x)$。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "p",
        "label": null,
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "这里$\\exp_a$是以$a$为底",
          "的指数函数的符号。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "p",
        "label": null,
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "当$a=1$时，不论自变量",
          "取任何值，指数函数所取的",
          "值都是1。就是说，对于任",
          "意的$x$：",
          "$\\exp_1(x)=1^x=1$。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "p",
        "label": null,
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "以后我们不讨论这种情形。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "p",
        "label": null,
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
        "samerow": false,
        "lines": [
          "在图67中，画出了底数",
          "$a$取某些值时指数函数的",
          "图象。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "cap",
        "label": "图 67",
        "box": null,
        "owner_exercise": null,
        "cont": false,
        "open": false,
